        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "c2c50960-3f77-599d-a66a-d9c49d21c8d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: Auction Kings, Pawn Stars\n- People: Lori Verderame, Rick Harrison\n- Companies: Gallery 63, History Channel, Discovery Channel, Gold & Silver Pawn Shop\n- Places: Sandy Springs, Georgia, Atlanta, Las Vegas\n\nFacts:\n- Pawn Stars debuted on July 26, 2009.\n- Pawn Stars became the History Channel's highest-rated show and the No. 2 reality show behind Jersey Shore.\n- Auction Kings premiered on October 26, 2010.\n- Auction Kings capitalized on the success of Pawn Stars.\n- Auction Kings featured the now defunct auction house Gallery 63 in Sandy Springs, Georgia, on Roswell Road just north of the Atlanta city limit.\n- Lori Verderame is the main appraiser on the American TV show Auction Kings, which airs internationally on Discovery Channel.\n- Rick Harrison, born March 22, 1965, is an American businessman and reality television personality based in Las Vegas.\n- Rick Harrison is best known as the co-owner of the World Famous Gold & Silver Pawn Shop, which is featured on Pawn Stars.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
